  "findings_zh": "两臂前 16 个输出 token 一致，第 17 个 token 在各自的 40／30 行图上首次分叉，此时批次均有 10 个请求和 30 个实际输入行。两路当步接纳的推测 token 边界不同，因此首处分叉不足以把后续截断归因到 30 行图。题干要四处的染色体数，选项采用染色体数与染色单体数交替的格式，两路都在这两种解读之间反复核对。30 行最后覆盖到 token 1,000。第 1,070 个 token 在 24 行图上重现从第 966 个 token 开始的 42-token 片段，第 1,234 个 token 显式再次核对选项。40 行在第 769 个 token 已显式回查，换到更小的图档后仍继续。30 行结果一度倾向 G，随后重开分析，两路均无最终选项。",
  "findings_en": "The first 16 output tokens matched. The first divergence was at token 17, with the native and candidate respectively replaying the 40- and 30-row graph for ten requests and 30 live rows. The speculative commit boundaries differed, so the divergence alone does not attribute truncation to the 30-row graph. Both responses repeatedly switched between the question's four chromosome counts and the answer choices' alternating chromosome and chromatid counts. The final 30-row replay committed through token 1,000. At token 1,070 the candidate repeated 42 tokens from token 966 while on the 24-row graph, and explicitly checked the choices again at token 1,234. The native arm explicitly rechecked at token 769 and continued after moving to smaller graphs. Neither response delivered a terminal choice."
